adword":"βρόμος κάλαμός ἐστι","lang":"grc","source":"dioscorides","text":"βρόμος κάλαμός ἐστι πυροῖς ὅμοιος καὶ τοῖς φύλλοις, γόνασιν ἐνδιειλημμένος, καρπὸν δὲ ἔχει ἐπʼ ἄκρῳ ὥσπερ ἀκρίδια δίκωλα, ἐν οἷς τὸ σπέρμα χρησιμεῦον εἰς καταπλάσματα ὡς ἡ κριθή· καὶ πόλτος δὲ ἐξ αὐτοῦ γίνεται σταλτικὸς κοιλίας. ὁ δὲ ἐξ αὐτοῦ χυλὸς ῥοφούμενος βήσσουσιν ἁρμόζει.","spans":[{"start":210,"end":225,"concept_id":"diarrhea","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":260,"end":264,"concept_id":"cough","polarity":"therapeutic"}]},"cul:218-oats":{"ref":"Culpeper, Complete Herbal: Oats,","headword":"Oats,","lang":"en","source":"culpeper","text":"Oats fried with bay salt, and applied to the sides, take away the pains of stitches and wind in the sides or the belly. A poultice made of meal of Oats, and some oil of Bays put thereunto, helps the itch and the leprosy, as also the fistulas of the fundament, and dissolves hard imposthumes. The meal of Oats boiled with vinegar, and applied, takes away freckles and spots in the face, and other parts of the body.","spans":[{"start":75,"end":83,"concept_id":"pain","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":88,"end":105,"concept_id":"flatulence","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":199,"end":203,"concept_id":"itch_scabies","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":212,"end":219,"concept_id":"scaly_skin","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":233,"end":258,"concept_id":"hemorrhoids","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":279,"end":290,"concept_id":"abscess","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":354,"end":362,"concept_id":"skin_blemishes","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":367,"end":372,"concept_id":"skin_blemishes","polarity":"therapeutic"}]}},"images":["wiener-dioskurides-bromos"]}